fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstinfo.html#GST_LOG_CONTEXT_BUILDER_SET_HASH_FLAGS","fragment":"\n\tGST_LOG_CONTEXT_BUILDER_SET_HASH_FLAGS\n\nSets the hash flags for the log context being built, which control how\nthe message hash is calculated.\nParameters:\nGstLogContextHashFlags to control message hash calculation\nthe same GstLogContextBuilder for chaining\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});